  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Making a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> available is optional; if not set, <a href=\"#setEndpointRegistry(org.springframework.data.redis.config.RedisListenerEndpointRegistry)\"><code>endpoint registry</code></a> has\nto be explicitly configured.",
      "translation": "使<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>可用是可选的；如果未设置，则必须显式配置<a href=\"#setEndpointRegistry(org.springframework.data.redis.config.RedisListenerEndpointRegistry)\"><code>端点注册表</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Process the given <a href=\"RedisListener.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.redis.annotation\"><code>RedisListener</code></a> annotation on the given method, registering a corresponding endpoint for\nthe given bean instance.",
      "translation": "处理给定方法上的<a href=\"RedisListener.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.annotation 中的注解接口\"><code>RedisListener</code></a>注解，为给定的 Bean 实例注册相应的端点。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"../config/RedisListenerEndpointRegistry.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.config\"><code>RedisListenerEndpointRegistry</code></a> that will hold the created endpoint.",
      "translation": "设置将用于保存已创建端点的<a href=\"../config/RedisListenerEndpointRegistry.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.config\"><code>RedisListenerEndpointRegistry</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> to use to configure the message listener responsible to serve an\nendpoint detected by this processor.",
      "translation": "将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/MessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>MessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> 设置为用于配置由该处理器检测到的端点所负责的消息监听器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a> is used. It can be configured further to support additional\nmethod arguments or to customize conversion and validation support. See <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a>\nJavadoc for more details.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，使用<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a>。它可以进一步配置以支持额外的方法参数，或自定义转换和验证支持。有关更多详细信息，请参阅<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/support/DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation.support\"><code>DefaultMessageHandlerMethodFactory</code></a>的 Javadoc。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
